Kawruh sesrawungan (asring diterjemahake kanthi jamak minangka èlmu sosial) minangka salah sawijining cawanganing kawruh, sing dikhususake kanggo sinau babagan &lt;a href="bebrayan"&gt;bebrayan&lt;/a&gt; lan kalula-lula antarane anggota ing bebrayan kasebut. Istilah iki biyen digunakake kanggo nyebut bidang &lt;a href="Sosiologi"&gt;wargasastra&lt;/a&gt;, "kawruhing pasrawungan" asli, sing diadegake ing abad kaping 18. Saliyane wargastastra, saiki kalebu macem-macem disiplin akademik, kalebu &lt;a href="Antropologi"&gt;jalmasastra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ark%C3%A9ologi"&gt;purwasastra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%C3%89konomi"&gt;bandhasastra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="G%C3%A9ografi"&gt;bhumisastra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sajarah"&gt;itihasa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Linguistik"&gt;basastra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tatasastra"&gt;tatasastra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="yuktisastra"&gt;yuktisastra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Psikologi"&gt;jiwasastra&lt;/a&gt;, budaya, lan &lt;a href="%C3%88lmu%20pulitik"&gt;prajasastra&lt;/a&gt;. 
