<doc id="199071" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=199071" title="Vincenzo Petrocelli">
Vincenzo Petrocelli

Vincenzo Pasquale Angelo Petrocelli (Cervaro, 6 Juli 1823 – Napoli, 2 Februari 1896) iku sawijining pelukis Italia. Dadi profesor kehormatan ing &lt;a href="Accademia%20di%20Belle%20Arti%20di%20Napoli"&gt;Akademi Seni Rupa Napoli&lt;/a&gt; lan sawetara akademi manca, lan nampa patronase saka &lt;a href="Ferdinando%20II%20delle%20Due%20Sicilie"&gt;Ferdinando II saka Rong Sisilia&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Biografi</h2>
Biografi.
Vincenzo Pasquale Angelo Petrocelli, kadhangkala ditulis minangka ‘‘Petroccelli’’, lair ing &lt;a href="Cervaro%20%28munisipalitas%29"&gt;Cervaro&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Karajan%20Rong%20Sisilia"&gt;Karajan Rong Sisilia&lt;/a&gt;. Dheweke dadi yatim enom, lan nalika umur 18 mlebu &lt;a href="Accademia%20di%20Belle%20Arti%20di%20Napoli"&gt;Accademia di Belle Arti di Napoli&lt;/a&gt;, sinau karo &lt;a href="Domenico%20Morelli%20%28pelukis%29"&gt;Domenico Morelli&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https%3A//archive.org/stream/domenicomorellin00levi%23page/105/mode/1up"&gt;P. Levi, ‘‘Domenico Morelli, nella vita e nell’arte’’, Roma-Torino, Roux e Viarengo, 1906, k. 105&lt;/a&gt;.
Debut ing ‘‘Esposizione Borbonica’’ taun 1839 lan melu maneh ing 1841, 1848 lan 1851 (’’Ginevra genuflessa…’’, ‘‘Morte di Galeazzo Sforza’’, ‘‘Isabella di Firenze’’, ‘‘Una famiglia di neofiti sorpresa dalle guardie pretoriane’’). Sawisé 1850 tekan kematangan artistik; ing 1851 nggambar ’’&lt;a href="Potret%C3%A9%20dhuk%20N.B.%20Yusupov%20enom"&gt;Potreté dhuk N.B. Yusupov enom&lt;/a&gt;’’ (saiki ana ing &lt;a href="Musiyum%20Ermitage"&gt;Musiyum Ermitage&lt;/a&gt;). Dheweke mèlu ‘‘Esposizione Nazionale d’arte di Napoli’’ (1877), lan bareng Morelli dipilih kanggo fresko ing &lt;a href="Candhi%20San%20Francesco%20%28Gaeta%29"&gt;Candhi San Francesco&lt;/a&gt; ing Gaeta. Dheweke seda ing &lt;a href="Napoli"&gt;Napoli&lt;/a&gt; taun 1896. Anake loro, &lt;a href="Achille%20Petrocelli"&gt;Achille&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Arturo%20Petrocelli"&gt;Arturo&lt;/a&gt;, uga dadi pelukis.&lt;a href="https%3A//www.google.it/books/edition/Bibliografia_per_la_storia_delle_arti_fi/mMAnTy1usikC%3Fhl%3Dit%26amp%3Bgbpv%3D1%26amp%3Bdq%3DArturo%2BPetrocelli%26amp%3Bpg%3DPA464%26amp%3Bprintsec%3Dfrontcover"&gt;G. Ceci, ‘‘Bibliografia per la storia delle arti figurative nell’Italia’’, 1937, k. 464&lt;/a&gt;
Karyane utamané nggambar adegan sajarah, potret lan &lt;a href="lukisan%20genre"&gt;lukisan genre&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="http%3A//www.oxfordartonline.com/subscriber/article/benezit/B00140020"&gt;‘‘Benezit Dictionary of Artists’’, entri: Petrocelli, Vincenzo Pasquale Angelo, Oxford Art Online&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Vincenzo%20Gemito"&gt;Vincenzo Gemito&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1869 nggawé potret terracotta saka dheweke.&lt;a href="http%3A//www.treccani.it/enciclopedia/vincenzo-gemito_%28Dizionario-Biografico%29/"&gt;E. Bianchi, ‘‘Gemito, Vincenzo’’, ing ‘‘Dizionario Biografico degli Italiani’’, jilid 53, Roma, Istituto dell’Enciclopedia Italiana, 2000&lt;/a&gt;
<h2>Karya ing musiyum</h2>
<ul>
<li>Koleksi Kraton saka Casa Savoia.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Musiyum%20Ermitage"&gt;Musiyum Ermitage&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="St.%20Petersburg"&gt;St. Petersburg&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https%3A//www.hermitagemuseum.org/wps/portal/hermitage/digital-collection/01.%2BPaintings/128699/%3Flng%3Denu"&gt;‘‘Portrait of Young Duke N.B. Yusupov’’, 1851, Hermitage Museum&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Reggia%20di%20Caserta"&gt;Reggia di Caserta&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https%3A//catalogo.beniculturali.it/detail/HistoricOrArtisticProperty/1500088906"&gt;‘‘Bice nel Castello di Rosato’’, 1860, Catalogo ICCD&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Musiyum%20Nasional%20Capodimonte"&gt;Musiyum Nasional Capodimonte&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https%3A//catalogo.beniculturali.it/detail/HistoricOrArtisticProperty/1500325020"&gt;‘‘Devoti in preghiera’’, 1849, Catalogo ICCD&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
</ul>
