Telu Karajan Koréa

Telu Karajan Koréa (ꦠꦼꦭꦸꦏꦫꦗꦤ꧀ꦏꦺꦴꦫꦺꦪ, &lt;a href="Basa%20Kor%C3%A9a"&gt;Basa Koréa&lt;/a&gt;: 삼국시대; &lt;a href="Hanja"&gt;Hanja&lt;/a&gt;: 三國時代) iku kalebu karajan &lt;a href="Baekje"&gt;Baekje&lt;/a&gt; (백제, 百濟), &lt;a href="Silla"&gt;Silla&lt;/a&gt; (신라, 新羅) lan &lt;a href="Goguryeo"&gt;Goguryeo&lt;/a&gt; (고구려, 高句麗). Goguryeo banjur ditepang dadi Goryeo (고려, 高麗), kang dadi asal saka jeneng &lt;a href="Kor%C3%A9a"&gt;Koréa&lt;/a&gt;. Jaman Telu Karajan kadadeyan saka 57 SM tekan 668 M. 
Telu Karajan nglungguhi saindengé &lt;a href="Jasirah%20Kor%C3%A9a"&gt;Jasirah Koréa&lt;/a&gt; lan sawatara setengah saka &lt;a href="Manchuria"&gt;Manchuria&lt;/a&gt;, kang papan ing &lt;a href="Cina"&gt;Cina&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; jaman iki. Karajan Baekje lan Silla nguwasani sisih kidul Jasirah Koréa lan &lt;a href="Tamna"&gt;Tamna&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Jejudo"&gt;pulo Jeju&lt;/a&gt;), dene Goguryeo nguwasani &lt;a href="Jasirah%20Liaodong"&gt;Jasirah Liaodong&lt;/a&gt;, Manchuria, lan sisih lor Jasirah Koréa.
